[engl]
{100}{}{Aradesh}
{200}{}{You see Aradesh, leader of Shady Sands.}
{1000}{}{Predialogue installations}
{1010}{}{Default}

{2000}{}{Greetings, wanderer. Please do not be offended if the gentlefolk about seem rude. Your business in Shady Sands might be?}
{2010}{}{Tell me about Shady Sands.}
{2020}{}{Tell me about the people here.}
{2030}{}{What can you tell me about the raiders?}
{2040}{}{What can you tell me about the Rad Scorpions?}
{2050}{}{What can you tell me about places around here?}
{2060}{}{Goodbye.}

{3000}{}{Shady Sands is much like a family, one that keeps to itself. We are a very protective community. As Dharma said, 'Many sticks can be broken. A bundle cannot.'}
{3010}{}{Where are the Gardens and Brahma Pens?}
{3020}{}{What kind of things do you have around here?}
{3030}{}{Are there any other cities around here?}
{3040}{}{Tell me about something else.}
{3050}{}{Thanks. Bye.}

{4000}{}{There are many people here who work to keep Shady Sands alive. I lead the town, Razlo is our doctor, and Seth is captain of our guards.}
{4010}{}{Tell me about Tandi.}
{4020}{}{Tell me about Seth.}
{4030}{}{Tell me about Razlo.}
{4040}{}{Tell me about something else.}
{4050}{}{Thanks. Bye.}

{5000}{}{There are two bands of raiders that we know of. They call themselves the Vipers and the Khans.}
{5010}{}{Tell me about the Vipers.}
{5020}{}{Tell me about the Khans.}
{5030}{}{What do they use?}
{5040}{}{Tell me about something else.}
{5050}{}{Thanks. Bye.}

{6000}{}{Oh my yes. Great packs of Rad Scorpions are killing our herds. We don't know where they're from, and no matter how many we kill, there's always more!}
{6010}{}{Where are the Rad Scorpions coming from?}
{6020}{}{How dangerous are they?}
{6030}{}{Who knows the most about them?}
{6040}{}{Tell me about something else.}
{6050}{}{Thanks. Bye.}

{7000}{}{Junktown lies south of here, though there is little in the way of visitation. From stories, I'm certain there are cities south of that.}
{7010}{}{Where can I find Junktown?}
{7020}{}{Tell me about something else.}
{7030}{}{Thanks. Bye.}

{8000}{}{The Gardens are on the south side. The Brahma Pens are north, although the smell is, I fear, quite intense this time of year.}
{8010}{}{Tell me about Shady Sands again.}
{8020}{}{Thanks. Bye.}

{9000}{}{We are small and self sufficient so there is little else to tell.}
{9010}{}{Tell me about Shady Sands again.}
{9020}{}{Thanks. Bye.}

{10000}{}{Junktown lies south of here, though there is little in the way of visitation. From stories, I'm certain there are cities south of that.}
{10010}{}{Tell me about places around here again.}
{10020}{}{Thanks. Bye.}

{11000}{}{She is my daughter. It is she that makes this hard life worth living.}
{11010}{}{Tell me about the people here.}
{11020}{}{Thanks. Bye.}

{12000}{}{A fine young man, Seth. Captain of our guards. He is likely to be at the Guard House.}
{12010}{}{Tell me about the people here.}
{12020}{}{Thanks. Bye.}

{13000}{}{The Vipers are fanatically religious and can be quite dangerous. No one here knows of their base.}
{13010}{}{Tell me about the raiders again.}
{13020}{}{Thanks. Bye.}

{14000}{}{The Khans are nastier than the Vipers. These barbarians attack from the southeast.}
{14010}{}{Tell me about the raiders again.}
{14020}{}{Thanks. Bye.}

{15000}{}{The Vipers and Khans both use spears. We know this from their attacks.}
{15010}{}{Tell me about the raiders again.}
{15020}{}{Thanks. Bye.}

{16000}{}{No one knows for certain, but the packs seem to be coming from the northeast.}
{16010}{}{Tell me about the Rad Scorpions again.}
{16020}{}{Thanks. Bye.}

{17000}{}{Mean creatures, they are. Be careful of their tail. Their poison can be lethal if not looked after.}
{17010}{}{Tell me about the Rad Scorpions again.}
{17020}{}{Thanks. Bye.}

{18000}{}{Razlo has been working on a cure for Rad Scorpion poison. He possesses far more information on these creatures than I.}
{18010}{}{Tell me about the Rad Scorpions again.}
{18020}{}{Thanks. Bye.}

{19000}{}{The Gardens are on the south side. The Brahma Pens are north, although the smell is, I fear, quite intense this time of year.}
{19010}{}{Tell me about Shady Sands again.}
{19020}{}{Thanks. Bye.}

{20000}{}{Junktown lies south of here. Their merchants occasionally come to trade, but not often.}
{20010}{}{Tell me about places around here again.}
{20020}{}{Thanks. Bye.}
